# Credentials and private runtime state must never enter the build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.ppk
**/.git
**/.local
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.cache
**/.swc
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.idea
.workbuddy
.claude
.tmp
var
logs
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sql
**/*.rdb
**/*.aof
# Production configuration copies must not enter any image layer.
**/root-password
**/health-password
**/admin-password
**/clients
**/users.acl
